sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant API as API (ipm-serviceaccount-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (ipm-serviceaccount-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CTRL as Controller (ipm-serviceaccount-controller)
  participant ZIT as Zitadel (UserService / OrgService)

  U->>API: POST /v1/ipm/serviceaccounts {organizationId, name, keys, roles, groups}
  API->>API: valida token JWT, permissão ipm.serviceaccount.create, bind e chaves públicas
  API->>API: calcula fingerprints SHA-256 e valida escopo via projeções locais
  API->>DB: Transação SQL: INSERT ipm.serviceaccount (Pending), INSERT outbox, INSERT idempotency
  API-->>U: 201 Created (Resource: phase Pending, generation 1)
  P->>DB: drena outbox pendente por ordem de sequence
  P->>NATS: publica desired.ipm.serviceaccount.<id>
  P->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
  NATS->>CTRL: entrega desired.changed (Informer -> Workqueue)
  CTRL->>DB: lê intenção vigente no SSOT
  CTRL->>CTRL: resolve permissões efetivas a partir dos catálogos
  CTRL->>ZIT: observa máquina no Zitadel
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 404 Not Found (absent)
  CTRL->>ZIT: AddMachineUser (com JWT token type) e AddMachineKey (chaves públicas PEM)
  CTRL->>ZIT: Adiciona membership e userGrant no Project Grant da organização
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 200 OK
  CTRL->>ZIT: reobserva máquina e autorizações
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 200 OK (present, ativa)
  CTRL->>DB: UPDATE ipm.serviceaccount SET phase = Ready, observed_generation = generation
